    - target: {fileID: 8557568673631317014, guid: a0dbeffc84669e24f994d387893a803d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentences.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: "He\u2019s right. CyberHeaven is all about freedom, but freedom requires
        a bit of chaos too, don\u2019t you think? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8557568673631317014, guid: a0dbeffc84669e24f994d387893a803d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: sentences.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: "Trust me, press that button. You\u2019ll understand what I mean soon
        enough. In a world like this, sometimes the only way to take control\u2026
        is to lose it."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8557568673631317014, guid: a0dbeffc84669e24f994d387893a803d, type: 3}
